Package: qt5-vos-plugin
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Qt 5 platform plugin for V\OS
 Runs Qt 5 applications as native V\OS applications: windows, menus,
 file dialogs, clipboard and keyboard go through the V\OS kits instead
 of X11 or Wayland.
